<title>USA: JAMES RIVER CALLS SERIES O PREFERRED SHRS.</title>
<headline>JAMES RIVER CALLS SERIES O PREFERRED SHRS.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>James River Corp said Thursday it will redeem all its outstanding series O preferred stock for $25.00 a share plus accrued dividends October 1.</p>
<p>The paper-product company said it will pay a final dividend on the preferred stock of $0.515625 a share on October 1 to holders of record on September 17.</p>
<p>It added the aggregate liquidation value of the 3.9 million shares of the series O 8.25 percent cumulative preferred stock is $98.1 million.  </p>
<p>Norwest Bank Minnesota NA in St. Paul, Minn., will act as the redemption agent.</p>
</text>
